From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:18:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] feat(web): leave the branch off the sidebar row's meta
 line

The card's meta line no longer shows the branch name and its worktree or
folder icon. Worker chips, pull request and diff indicators, the machine
icon and the provider avatar keep their place; a meta line with only a
branch collapses. The row's hover card still names the branch.
---
